{"asset_key":"timeline/timeline_story_1301010436","episode":"timeline","category":"timeline_story","story_id":"1301010436","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:4:1310423001:0":{"text":"皆の者、騒ぎを起こした者や生きた屍は皆、勇士たちの手で駆逐された。大公の名において、舞踏会の続行を宣言する！","source_cn":"各位，闹事者已被驱离，活死人也被无畏的勇士们制服了！现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD1D1A1B5BE60075","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310423002:1":{"text":"神は我々を見守ってくださる。必ずやその加護のもと、祭典を完遂させようぞ！","source_cn":"至高无上的神明在注视着我们，我们必能在神的护佑下完成祭典！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7A8B0BD8C5F9B14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310423003:1":{"text":"ええ？あんなに恐ろしい事があったのに、まだ踊れるんですか？","source_cn":"什么？都出了这样可怕的事情，还要继续奏乐，继续跳舞？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A6C9CC4677C73F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310423004:0":{"text":"だからだよ。皆、生きた屍が怖いから舞踏会を続けるのだ。","source_cn":"漫漫女士，其实正是因为大家都惧怕活死人，所以舞会才要继续。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78A8345D35E92412","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310423005:0":{"text":"どういう意味です？","source_cn":"可……为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6BBD639220C9524","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310423006:0":{"text":"この地では、屍はカタストロフの眷族だと言われている。そしてカタストロフを倒した英雄を讃えるのがこの祭典だ。","source_cn":"在白山的传说中，这些活死人都是恶魔的眷属，而祭典却是为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AF058D47B221F8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310423007:0":{"text":"祭典を最後までやり遂げ、「選ばれし者」が氷像に火を灯すことで、英雄の魂が人々をカタストロフから守ってくれると皆信じているのだ。","source_cn":"人们会认真完成祭典的每个环节，从中选出“受选者”来点亮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADDFD98C45D5C0EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310423008:0":{"text":"なるほど……でも、こんな大勢で集まるのは危険では……","source_cn":"原来如此……可是，这么多人，还是很危险啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE681D5102572725","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310423009:0":{"text":"そこは私が目を光らせておく。幸い、舞踏会が終われば、残るは最後の点火式だけだ。","source_cn":"我会更加戒备的。还好……祭典已经进入尾声，舞会之后就是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5513BEB76BB3950","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1310425001:1":{"text":"皆の者、ここにいるのが今年の「選ばれし者」だ！","source_cn":"女士们，先生们，这位就是今年祭典的“受选者”！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2F62E1097932E1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1310425002:1":{"text":"舞踏会が終わった後は、儀式会場にて、冬の祭典の最も神聖なる栄光のひとときを共に迎えようぞ！","source_cn":"舞会结束后，请大家前往仪式现场，一起见证冬日祭典中最为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9F8006D4DD6F47B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1310425003:1":{"text":"そうそう、点火する前に、「選ばれし者」は氷像に<style=\"highlight\">七弁のセレストレア</style>を献上するのよ。","source_cn":"对了，你们还不知道吧，点火之前，“受选者”需要为冰雕献...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D7B456BFB361E1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1310425004:1":{"text":"ですが、セレストレアの花びらは六枚では？","source_cn":"可是……公主殿下，蓝绒花不是六瓣的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE8AD3E779082288","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1310425005:1":{"text":"七枚のもあるのよ。ここでは、花びらが七枚あるセレストレアは古代の英雄の意志が宿る<style=\"highlight\">「奇跡」の象徴</style>なの。","source_cn":"是呀！但是也有七瓣的蓝绒花。在白山，七瓣的蓝绒花是<s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB57C58F4671594B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1310425006:1":{"text":"歴史の先生が言ってたの。カタストロフとの戦いはほぼ絶望的だったんだけど――","source_cn":"历史老师说，过去与恶魔的抗争非常惨烈，几乎是不可能赢的战争。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8764C2F7E06C4D53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_ti